4-b42a-d1608755fcaf\">(취업이 어려워 자립심 키워주려 딸이름으로 했다가..ㅜㅜ</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-116012c3-7b21-46df-afc5-bddb87ab1e10\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-9b282939-8574-4c60-b047-a6890cc8059d\">처음에는 잘되어서 잘했다 싶었는데, 지금은 너무 후회스럽습니다.)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-587d793a-af33-4d3b-aa19-601f59360b58\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-710b2866-df54-4d6f-92df-47642841c6c6\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c5c5d7d3-ceb0-4bea-9b9e-cbf642798fb4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-682fa0ef-3e9d-4c1f-bf2c-a20601733e76\">[문의2]</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3d657893-b376-4d72-8221-768724f7b3dd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d5f934c9-e407-4151-8aca-fe0afc819c6a\">부실우려에서 원장 초기화 되면 부실차주로 접수시 누락된 채무껀 추가 할수 있나요?</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f01d6598-6405-4a3e-9801-f6cd18c29a18\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-2366d5c0-c746-40ba-ba5d-7644c6a15391\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d2606beb-ded4-4d79-8deb-f735d3b3af50\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a5c9048f-38e0-483b-9233-56fdf37df8cc\">부실우려에 접수시 누락된 부분이 없이 다 된줄 알았는데,</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6a593885-80f9-4283-9724-e18db5626c25\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5a18e446-1a73-4073-98a5-cf2578fd3e9a\">에를 들어 농협 은행대출연체와 농협카드연체 둘다 기록 했는데, 카드는 추가되지않은것 같아요.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-56923b78-4c9d-42fd-84a9-998724135fcd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-96e175ff-e9d5-4119-a042-3b1b34fac828\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4fdc25c2-e785-4a74-b6ba-30fd9e17da00\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-830a82c8-41e3-4f35-a260-c1dc3a09a239\">제이름으로는 상담사가 안내해준 금액이 수정조정이후 거의 비슷하게 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fe2abf4c-72e2-46e0-9eb3-c0e178b64349\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4e93325b-68ea-4267-aacd-0604125230b2\">70만원 정도 매달 내는 금액으로 얼마전 조정 됐는데</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-011e82d4-8b3c-4bc9-a1f5-ed929ba1b48a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7b37c501-b0f7-4e4a-b0c8-25bad1c5ca2c\">딸꺼는 아직 수정조정이후에도 40여 만원 정도네요.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-44215c25-044e-4070-84ba-c2ec7f7b7c7a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-6313146f-7727-4602-a2e8-62d994e509bb\">각각 6~7개사에서 채권양도가 아직 이루어지지 않은걸까요? </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-63cd7e82-b03e-41cb-8e38-bb63a025fc36\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f620da2f-9db0-42f5-ab23-0bc83cc521ae\">둘다 동시에 한 날 진행했거든요..ㅜㅜ</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a7defd3e-4320-4ef5-918a-b7c528bb3f5c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-316baade-3a7f-4cdc-beed-689b384b3b00\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fef9f0ac-d0dd-42e2-9ac5-75c4efca6d50\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-02401e69-15e8-405b-9572-a514999bc87d\">참고로 저희는 기초 수급자 입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-fffd6cc7-e6ff-4146-a801-35e3dfd8735b\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>    </div>\n</div>\n",
